					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="475dcc82198babf5" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="1ab55a29c4236818">Dies <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">ist wichtig</pc>, aber dies ist <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:em" swi18n:slot="children">subtil</pc>. Dies ist <pc id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children">auch wichtig</pc>.</target>
